Add a reminder

Usage: nib task add [OPTIONS] <TITLE>...

Arguments:
  <TITLE>...  Title; the words are joined with spaces

Options:
      --json                 Print JSON instead of text
  -l, --list <NAME>          Reminder list to add to
  -d, --due <DATE>           Due date: natural date or YYYY-MM-DD
  -p, --priority <PRIORITY>  [possible values: low, medium, high]
  -h, --help                 Print help
